WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.750
I can't believe you're a spy.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:09.710
There was no other way to get across the Wall.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.790
Of course.

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:15.630
But those clothes really suit you.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Is that a compliment?

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:20.580
Or...

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.790
It's both.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.920
Anyway, now we've fooled Control.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.210
Let's run away together.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.580
I have the route planned out.

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:35.790
There's a white house waiting for us
in Casablanca. We can...

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:36.880
I can't.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.040
I told you.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.920
I need your help

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.630
to make me Queen.

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.000
You don't mean...

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.670
That old promise?

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:55.420
With the Wall gone, we can be together
and it won't matter who knows it.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.540
That's true, but...

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:58.710
But...

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.250
I understand.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:01.750
I know it won't be easy.

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:03.540
No, you don't understand!

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.880
Morgan MP was killed on the way to hospital.

00:01:13.330 --> 00:01:14.250
Why?

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:17.250
The people at the top were afraid he would talk.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:18.960
So they silenced him.

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:23.000
That's the world I live in.

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:24.170
That's why I...

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:25.130
Even so...

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:27.630
Even so.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.000
I want to be Queen

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.830
and eliminate the things that come between us.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.210
All right. I'll do it.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:42.960
Ange!

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:46.170
I will deceive them all.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:48.880
I'll deceive you,

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:49.960
the world...

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.540
and...

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.420
even myself.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.290
It is the turn of the 20th century.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:35.000
The Kingdom of Albion's new royal air force,
commonly known as the Air Fleet,

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:38.040
has created a dramatic shift
in the balance of global power.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:43.960
With its monopoly on Cavorite,
and the Air Fleet at its command,

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:47.710
the Kingdom of Albion became
the greatest world power since the Roman Empire.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.500
However,

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:53.330
revolution split the kingdom into East and West,

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:58.000
with the London Wall separating the Kingdom of Albion
from the Commonwealth of Albion.

00:03:59.080 --> 00:04:07.080
Ten years later, London became the front-line
of a secret war fought between the nations' spies.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.040
How did you like this morning's tea, Your Highness?

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:19.380
I was just in the mood for some Nuwara Eliya.

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.130
You know me so well, Beatrice.

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:27.040
Today, you're expected to attend
the send-off for the Crown Prince at 10.

00:04:27.460 --> 00:04:31.420
Then you will be participating in the
inaugural meeting of the Life Improvement Society,

00:04:31.420 --> 00:04:34.500
and reading a message on behalf of
Her Majesty the Queen.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.000
Thank you, Beatrice.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.170
And...

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.790
I'm sorry.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:44.460
For making that decision about Ange
without talking to you.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.710
I'm against it.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:51.290
Those people are spies!

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:55.210
Their job is to trick and deceive people.

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:57.710
We can't trust them!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.170
But they do say,
"The enemy of my enemy is my friend."

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:06.210
Anyway, Your Highness, I will protect you,
just like I always have...

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.630
Princess, you in there?

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:12.960
Wow, I didn't think your room would be so plain.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:15.880
Wh-where are your manners?!
You don't have an appointment!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.790
I'm visiting a friend. Don't be so uptight.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:19.830
A friend?!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.210
We're all fellow students here, aren't we?

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.540
Maybe on the surface, but...!

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:26.330
If we're going to be friends, we'll need a reason.

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.630
What should our story be?

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.420
We grew up together on the Black Lizard Planet.

00:05:31.420 --> 00:05:32.460
No!

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:34.380
What about cross-dressing?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.420
We know the Princess' unspeakable secret!

00:05:36.420 --> 00:05:37.500
Certainly not!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.460
Why would Her Highness do something so indecent?!

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:42.540
Then back to the Black Lizard Planet idea...

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:43.330
No!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:45.960
Absolutely not!

00:05:48.170 --> 00:05:50.330
Welcome to our club room.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.540
Club room?

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.830
If we tell everyone it's for our club,
we can get away with all kinds of things.

00:05:54.960 --> 00:05:58.290
We'll figure out exactly what club it is later.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.290
Oof!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.960
Are they all... real?

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.210
You did all this yourself, Dorothy?

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:09.630
Are you impressed with me now?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:12.670
Yes, I'll come to you next time
I'm making an anteater hutch.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.290
Nice work getting the safety off.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:20.920
Your Highness!

00:06:20.920 --> 00:06:22.040
And you lot!

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:24.420
Bringing Her Highness into such a dangerous place...!

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:26.330
What are you thinking?!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:30.250
The truth is, we have orders from Control.

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:36.000
You mean from the director of the Commonwealth spies
who are infiltrating the Kingdom?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:39.290
Our orders are to board HMS Gloucester

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:42.130
and recover the printing plates
for the Commonwealth Pound.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.830
Why would the Royal Air Force have plates
for Commonwealth currency?

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:47.210
They were stolen.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:53.630
The Duke of Normandy plans to mass-produce pound
notes in the colonies to create financial instability.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:55.960
That's where Princess comes in.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:07:00.500
We need you to board the Gloucester
and create an opening for us to stow away.

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:02.880
So this is my first mission.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:05.580
No! I won't let her do anything so dangerous!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:06.500
Don't worry.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.290
If the worst should happen...

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:13.830
I'll take her place.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.710
In that case, our beginner has nothing to worry about.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:19.420
It's true. It's like I'm looking in a mirror.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:21.080
Your Highness!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.580
How can you be so calm?!

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:25.920
These people are-

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:28.710
Beatrice!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.170
Excuse me!

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.290
What was THAT all about?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:37.710
There was a mechanism in her throat.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:53.960
Beatrice's father is known for
being fanatical about machines.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.210
Possessed by machines himself,

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:02.750
he eventually began to experiment
on his own daughter.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:10.790
It's the mechanical girl!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.130
Go on, say something!

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:13.710
Yuck, she smells like oil!

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:19.880
...ness!

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:21.040
Your Highness!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:24.210
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:25.960
Your Highness!

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.580
Come on, Beatrice.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.080
Let's you and I be friends.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:40.710
Your Highness, I don't think those people
are just any spies.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.170
They mean to replace you.

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:50.670
I know. I know God won't do anything for us.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:54.380
The police work for the Duke of Normandy,

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:58.880
and the Duke of Anquitaine, Lord High Admiral...
he can hardly be considered an ally.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.130
I'm the only one...

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.380
...who can protect you.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.170
I'm terribly sorry for dropping in unannounced.

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:13.210
This is where we held the send-off
for His Royal Highness Prince Abyssinian.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:16.420
We are deeply honored to have you, Princess.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.880
This will certainly improve our sailors' morale.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:39.040
Our ship will be preparing for departure soon.

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.170
We don't have much to offer,
but perhaps some Kalinga tea...

00:09:42.170 --> 00:09:43.710
My, that sounds lovely.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.000
I can't let you go any farther, Miss.

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.960
Oh, that's hardly friendly.

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:51.580
Classified material's in there.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:53.920
If you like, you could wait in the Officers' Mess...

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.130
Actually...

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:58.040
There's somewhere else I'd really like to go.

00:09:58.040 --> 00:10:00.460
A-as long as it's somewhere I can authorize.

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:04.040
I can't hold it in any longer.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.960
Why did you come along?

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:21.380
You hate us, don't you?

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.540
I-I'm here for Her Highness!

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:26.210
I'm keeping an eye on you,
to make sure you don't try anything funny!

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:27.330
Don't bother.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.420
You're an amateur. You'll never hit me.

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:33.460
I'd be so embarrassed if you heard me.

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:35.290
Could you step away, please?

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.960
I-I beg your pardon!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.960
Answer me! Why do you
look so much like Her Highness?

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:02.880
Because Princess and I
are sisters from the Black Lizard Planet.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:04.130
Don't joke with me!

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:08.630
You're planning to replace her.
That's why you look like her!

00:11:08.630 --> 00:11:09.460
Isn't it?!

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:24.000
Almost time to go.

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:26.630
What? But-!

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:29.170
Save the chat for teatime.

00:11:29.670 --> 00:11:30.500
Wait!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:34.880
I said wait!

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:06.420
No! I have to protect Her Highness!

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:39.960
You're awake, then?

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.210
Y-you'll get no thanks from me!

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:46.670
I don't want any.

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:48.130
Anyway, hurry.

00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:52.380
Once we get the plates,
we're parachuting out of here.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.920
You want me to help a spy? I would rather die!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.920
Then die.

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.170
For your princess.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:05.920
If you got caught, they would have no trouble
cracking an amateur like you.

00:13:06.210 --> 00:13:10.580
Then they'll know that Princess
made a deal with the Commonwealth.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:14.880
I... I would never do anything
to sell out Her Highness!

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:17.080
Then get caught and see.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.710
A professional interrogation
is more than just a chat.

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:23.920
Is somebody in there?

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:26.830
What's up?

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:29.330
Oh, nothing. I thought I heard voices.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.790
Voices?

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.250
A telephone switchboard?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:00.880
This is Corporal Henry, Royal Marines 2nd Company,

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:01.830
I've just completed my guard shift.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:02.790
This is engine watch.
I've just completed my guard shift.

00:14:02.790 --> 00:14:03.080
Distillation amounts are normal.
I've just completed my guard shift.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:03.540
Distillation amounts are normal.

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:04.130
Distillation amounts are normal.
Naval command, copy that.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:04.710
Naval command, copy that.

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:05.290
No effect on the ship's internal gravity.

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:06.420
Now you go dream about that fiancee of yours.
No effect on the ship's internal gravity.

00:14:06.420 --> 00:14:06.960
Now you go dream about that fiancee of yours.
The Cavorite jammer has activated.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:08.710
Jennifer, was it?
The Cavorite jammer has activated.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:08.880
When we get there, you're paying me back.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.420
No... are you listening to all of them at once?
When we get there, you're paying me back.

00:14:11.420 --> 00:14:12.130
Get me Number One.

00:14:12.130 --> 00:14:12.460
Not at all. The world of economics
makes a fine battlefield.

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.670
Not at all. The world of economics
makes a fine battlefield.
About that missing special delivery...

00:14:14.670 --> 00:14:15.580
This is the Chief Gunner. Prepare for arms inspection.

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:20.250
You need money to feed your troops
and pay for weapons and ammunition.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.920
And to add troublesome cargo to your warship's load.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.250
I appreciate your cooperation, Captain.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:28.580
I will put in a good word for you
with the Duke of Normandy.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.330
Yes, I hope you will.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:32.540
What was that?

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.670
The captain and one of the Duke of Normandy's men.

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.500
The one responsible for transporting the plates.

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.460
The gun room.

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.170
Here.

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.250
It's so far away.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.790
And we have to go past the sailors' cabins?

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.540
Wh-what?

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.920
It does seem difficult.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.880
We'll take a different route.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.580
Change into this.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.080
You're still wet. It will be cold outside.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.540
"Outside"?

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.000
Do you see that turret?

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.830
The plates are under that.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.290
I'll go first.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:25.710
"First"?

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:33.420
When I pull the wire three times, come after me.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.630
No! I couldn't possibly...!

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.000
Think of Her Highness.

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.880
Is that...?

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:12.460
Miss Ange!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.420
Miss Ange!

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.420
Someone's out there!

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.040
This is the underboard quarter crow's nest!

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.500
A suspicious person has appeared
below the fourth port hatch!

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:36.960
An intruder?

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:40.710
What's this about, then?

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:41.250
Sir!

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.130
There appears to be an intruder
on the ship's exterior.

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:44.630
Don't give me that nonsense!

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.000
We're in the middle of the sky!

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:47.920
Dammit! Shut off that siren!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:09.210
How in the...?

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.130
She's coming this way.

00:17:22.460 --> 00:17:25.080
Dash it all, she IS after the plates!

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:28.750
Miss Ange...

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:31.380
The door's locked!

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:32.670
Bring a cannon!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:37.630
Confound it!

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:38.920
What IS she?

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.290
She's an intruder! Kill her!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.960
S-stop shooting!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.170
Fire!

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:15.540
There should be another one in here! Find them!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.830
Oww... Miss Ange...

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.380
Miss Ange!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.580
Are you all right?

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.670
The plates.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.960
Take them... and get out of here.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:19:00.210
When you reach the ground... call Dorothy.

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:03.710
I-I told you I refuse to help a spy!

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:04.880
Give it to her yourself-!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.380
Just... go!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:12.250
But there are plenty of other para...

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.380
No...

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:16.920
Major!

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:18.630
Major, are you all right?

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:19.420
Hurry.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.330
Hurry.
Oscar! Norman!

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.460
Save yourself.
Oscar! Norman!

00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:21.670
Save yourself.
Answer me! Dammit!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.830
Take the plates.
Answer me! Dammit!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.290
Honestly! What is it about you spies?!

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.500
Is the mission that important to you?!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:29.500
I don't know how much they pay you,

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:33.170
but is patriotism and principle
really worth risking your life over?!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:35.630
When you're dead, it's all over!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:38.540
Beatrice.

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:42.880
If I die here, I'm just a spy.

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:47.750
But if YOU get caught, they'll suspect Princess.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.540
And I will not let that happen!

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:54.040
Major! We're going to blow the door down!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:56.040
If you can hear me, please step back!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.920
We'll charge as soon as we fire!

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:01.000
All hands, prepare for impact!

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.380
Ready and...

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:03.580
Don't fire!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:07.500
I'm fine. I dealt with the intruder!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.580
The door was warped in the fight
and won't open, that's all.

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:14.630
I have everything under control here,
so you make sure there aren't any others!

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:16.420
Yes, Sir!

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:21.960
Major!

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:23.710
Wh-what is it?

00:20:23.710 --> 00:20:25.330
This is Sergeant Stewart.

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:27.210
How did everything go the other day?

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.210
"The other day"?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.080
The other day...

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:32.540
Beatrice.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:37.460
Enough of your jokes.
I know that voice, Corporal Henry.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.380
You're going to propose to Jennifer, aren't you?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.420
Go win yourself some glory.

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.540
Yes, Sir! Excuse me, Sir!

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:50.630
How did you know?

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.080
I heard his voice back at the switchboard.

00:21:03.290 --> 00:21:08.000
It's all or nothing. If the Cavorite breaks
before we land, we might both die!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.500
I don't care!

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:10.500
Here goes!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:22.000
I love Her Highness!

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.750
I love her kindness, her elegance,
her intelligence... all of it!

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:29.290
So I'm going to protect her!

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:35.330
I'll keep her safe from everything,
and be someone worthy to stand beside her!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:36.670
And I...!

00:21:36.880 --> 00:21:39.830
I hate that stupid Princess!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:54.000
I knew it.

00:21:54.000 --> 00:21:56.500
You are a liar, Miss Ange.

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:05.080
So how about we say we became friends
because of our common fondness for whiskey?

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.500
Couldn't you at least make it wine?

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:09.580
Dorothy just wants to drink.

00:22:09.710 --> 00:22:11.710
What if we're all sea turtle egg-laying enthusiasts?

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.420
What? What does that even mean?

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:16.460
Exactly what it sounds like.

00:22:19.380 --> 00:22:22.710
Etiquette dictates that at teatime,
we all enjoy it together.

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:26.630
I like salt in my tea.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:30.920
Salt from the Black Lizard Planet.

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:33.040
Please, take your time.

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:34.290
Thanks.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.540
This salt is awfully sweet.

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:39.000
Because it's high quality.

00:22:39.000 --> 00:22:40.420
You girls...
